n-type="journal">Wang, X. <year>2001</year>. The expanding role of mitochondria in apoptosis. <source>Genes Dev.</source> <volume>15</volume>:<fpage>2922</fpage>&#x02013;2933.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11711427</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib31"><citation citation-type="journal">Wright, K.M., M.W. Linhoff, P.R. Potts, and M. Deshmukh. <year>2004</year>. Decreased apoptosome activity with neuronal differentiation sets the threshold for strict IAP regulation of apoptosis. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>167</volume>:<fpage>303</fpage>&#x02013;313.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15504912</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib32"><citation citation-type="journal">Yakovlev, A.G., K. Ota, G. Wang, V. Movsesyan, W.-L. Bao, K. Yoshihara, and A.I. Faden. <year>2001</year>. Differential expression of apoptotic protease-activating factor-1 and caspase-3 genes and susceptibility to apoptosis during brain development and after traumatic brain injury. <source>J. Neurosci.</source> <volume>21</volume>:<fpage>7439</fpage>&#x02013;7446.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11567033</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>